Bundled third-party software: the CORAS diagram editor
------------------------------------------------------

tool/ contains the CORAS diagram editor 2.0 ("Threat Modelling Tool", 2007) by
SINTEF, together with the libraries it ships with. It is redistributed here
**unmodified, byte for byte**, so that the MCP server has something to draw
into and to render with.

